  "idiom": "Only two inks exist: blue (fg) and pink (accent); overlaps read as a third colour. Halftone dots and hatch fields instead of gradients; slight offsets between the two inks (the CA knob is your misregistration). Hand-cut shapes, stickers, stamped words; nothing glows."
